WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.500
<v Marco Rossi>Okay, so I checked with the SAP team about the API limits.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Marco Rossi>The gateway allows 50 requests per second for the billing endpoints, so we will need caching for bill lists.

3
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:18.000
<v Tom Becker>Hosting is confirmed on Azure, UK South region, because of data residency. Customer data must stay in the UK.

4
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:25.000
<v Aisha Khan>For bills, we have standard, estimated, and corrected bills. Corrected bills must show the reason for the correction.

5
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Priya Nair>We also need accessibility, WCAG 2.2 AA at minimum, a lot of our customers are elderly.

6
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:38.000
<v Tom Becker>Pages should load in under two seconds for 95 percent of requests. And availability of 99.5 percent outside the Sunday maintenance window.

7
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:44.000
<v Aisha Khan>Customers should get an email notification when a new bill is ready.

8
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:50.000
<v Priya Nair>Could we add SMS notifications too? Maybe as a nice to have.

9
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:55.000
<v Marco Rossi>Sure, but we don't have an SMS provider yet, so that is open.
